# Self-registers a new Tenant account (email + password). No auth required —
# reachable regardless of AUTH_ENABLED. No tokens are issued here; call
# tenancy.login.rest next.

### Happy path
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery-staple"
}

### Duplicate email — expect 409
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "another-password-here"
}

### Malformed body — expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}
